<title>HONG KONG: Nomura Int'l sets Cathay Life warrants.</title>
<headline>Nomura Int'l sets Cathay Life warrants.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nomura International Plc said it issued 1.50 million American style call warrants on shares of Taiwan's Cathay Life Insurance.</p>
<p>One warrant controls one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	US$5.439     PREMIUM	 N/A</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	 US$1.390     GEARING	 N/A</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	  26.AUG.97    PAYDATE	 10.SEPT.96</p>
<p> LISTING	     LUXEMBOURG   MIN EXER LOT  N/A</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE    US$6.043</p>
<p> NOTE		  US$1.00 to NT$27.468</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
